# LeakSanitizer suppressions for code we do not own.
# Mesa's EGL/llvmpipe driver keeps process-lifetime allocations made while SDL
# initialises the offscreen EGL display (frames below are in the driver, which
# has no symbols because Mesa is dlopen'ed and unloaded at exit).
leak:SDL_EGL_InitializeOffscreen
# The driver's own allocations during draw calls hang off that display. The
# functions below only issue GL draw calls and never allocate themselves.
leak:cadv_gpu_mesh_draw
leak:draw_sprite_range
leak:post_pass
